# Cloudflare Pages Routing Configuration

# Redirect apex domain to www (301 permanent redirect for SEO)
http://itvedas.com/*  https://www.itvedas.com/:splat  301
https://itvedas.com/* https://www.itvedas.com/:splat  301

# CVE Database Routing - Consolidated to /articles/cve/
# All /cve/* requests redirect to /articles/cve/ (301 for SEO)
/cve              /articles/cve/     301
/cve/             /articles/cve/     301

# Individual CVE detail pages: cve-listing.html's viewCVE() navigates to
# /cve/{id}/, and cve-detail.html reads the ID back out of the URL path
# client-side. These rewrites must come before the catch-all below or
# every per-CVE link gets swallowed into the generic /articles/cve/ listing.
/cve/:id/         /cve-detail.html   200
/cve/:id          /cve-detail.html   200

/cve/:splat       /articles/cve/     301

# NOTE: Cloudflare Pages automatically serves .html files for extensionless URLs
# No need for explicit .html redirects - they cause infinite loops!

# Deals page removed 2026-07 — send old links home
/deals.html       /                  301
/deals            /                  301

